import sys, yaml, re
SP = "C:/Users/3D6B~1/AppData/Local/Temp/claude/C--visual-projects-game/44586b9f-03e1-4b03-8523-201e45adf5a9/scratchpad/"
part = sys.argv[1]
orig = yaml.safe_load(open(SP + f"k4b09_orig{part}.yaml", encoding="utf-8"))
new = yaml.safe_load(open(f"C:/visual projects/reverse-kit/pipeline/_work/run_wol2/records/collections/c-fsm_catalogs.part{part}.yaml", encoding="utf-8"))
ids = set()
for c in orig["candidates"]:
    for t in c["type"].split("."):
        ids.add(t)
    for x in c.get("calls", []):
        ids.add(x)
    for f in c.get("data_fields", []):
        ids.add(f["name"])
    for n in c.get("numeric_literals", []):
        ids.add(n["member"])
ids = {i for i in ids if len(i) > 3}
texts = []
def add(label, s):
    texts.append((label, str(s)))
add("goal", new["goal"])
for q in new["open_questions"]:
    add("oq", q)
for a in new["acceptance"]:
    add("acc", a)
for r in new["catalog"]:
    add(r["id"] + ":name", r["own_name"])
    add(r["id"] + ":beh", r.get("behavior", ""))
    for k, v in (r.get("numbers") or {}).items():
        add(r["id"] + ":numkey", k)
        if isinstance(v, dict):
            add(r["id"] + ":numnote", v.get("note", ""))
            add(r["id"] + ":numunit", v.get("unit", ""))
        else:
            add(r["id"] + ":numval", v)
hits = {}
for label, s in texts:
    for i in ids:
        if re.search(r"(?<![A-Za-z0-9_])" + re.escape(i) + r"(?![A-Za-z0-9_])", s):
            hits.setdefault(i, []).append(label)
# camelCase / PascalCase tokens in public text
for label, s in texts:
    for m in re.findall(r"[A-Za-z]+[A-Z][a-z]+[A-Za-z]*", s):
        hits.setdefault("CAMEL:" + m, []).append(label)
for k, v in hits.items():
    print(k, v[:4])
print("done", len(hits))

